    "title": "Liban shop",
    "description": "Liban shop mice are very lovable, sweet and charming. They are our stress reliever, our companion, and our best loyal friends. We play with them, feed them, and share the bed with them. Owning rats provides us with a lot of benefits \u2013 in physical health, emotional health, and even mental health. it is fun\r\n\r\nThe Liban Shop helps you simulate what it's like to have mice in the house while earning rewards. It's like owning a real mouse. Your daily tasks are simple - every day you log in to play with him, you click the mouse and earn points on a daily basis, which you can later convert into a reward. Enjoy the Liban Shop game together",
